    {
      "displayText": "Ghost-type Pokémon are weak to Dark-type\nmoves...and Ghost-type moves. Do you know what<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthat means?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
