      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200063006C007500650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In a battle between Ghost types, speed plays a\nlarge part in determining the outcome...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So what say we have a battle to decide which of\nus is the superior Ghost-type user?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Once you and your Ghost-type Pokémon are\nready, please let me know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E0063006500200079006F007500200061006E006400200079006F00750072002000470068006F00730074002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006100720065000A00720065006100640079002C00200070006C00650061007300650020006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F0077002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Be sure to only bring Ghost-type Pokémon for our\nbattle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200650020007300750072006500200074006F0020006F006E006C00790020006200720069006E0067002000470068006F00730074002D007400790070006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200066006F00720020006F00750072000A0062006100740074006C0065002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ready to see who’s the superior Ghost-type user?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
