      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610079006200650020006C00610074006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Huh? You brought a<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁýࠀ team of Ghost-type Pokémon\nlike I<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nasked, but you’re not going to battle me?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
