      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007300740069006C006C0020006C006F00730074002E002E002E00100002011401650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Even my backup plan of giving my Pokémon Spell\nTags to strengthen their Ghost-type moves failed.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know you helped Ivor and Gwynn bury the\nhatchet before, so your skill in battle shouldn’t<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncome as such a surpr—<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕť",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
